{"ch": 101, "verses": [{"n": 1, "ar": "بِسۡمِ اللّٰہِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِیۡمِ ﴿۱﴾", "en": "In the name of Allah, the Gracious, the Merciful.", "w": ["in the name of", "Allah", "the Gracious", "the Merciful", ""]}, {"n": 2, "ar": "اَلۡقَارِعَۃُ ۙ﴿۲﴾", "en": "The great Calamity!", "w": ["the great Calamity", ""]}, {"n": 3, "ar": "مَا الۡقَارِعَۃُ ۚ﴿۳﴾", "en": "What is the great Calamity?", "w": ["what", "is the great Calamity", ""]}, {"n": 4, "ar": "وَمَاۤ اَدۡرٰٮکَ مَا الۡقَارِعَۃُ ؕ﴿۴﴾", "en": "And what should make thee know what the great Calamity is?", "w": ["and what", "should make thee know", "what", "the great Calamity is", ""]}, {"n": 5, "ar": "یَوۡمَ یَکُوۡنُ النَّاسُ کَالۡفَرَاشِ الۡمَبۡثُوۡثِ ۙ﴿۵﴾", "en": "The day when mankind will be like scattered moths,", "w": ["the day", "when will be", "mankind", "like moths", "scattered", ""]}, {"n": 6, "ar": "وَتَکُوۡنُ الۡجِبَالُ کَالۡعِہۡنِ الۡمَنۡفُوۡشِ ؕ﴿۶﴾", "en": "And the mountains will be like carded wool.", "w": ["and will be", "the mountains", "like wool", "carded", ""]}, {"n": 7, "ar": "فَاَمَّا مَنۡ ثَقُلَتۡ مَوَازِیۡنُہٗ ۙ﴿۷﴾", "en": "Then, as for him whose scales are heavy,", "w": ["then, as for", "him whose", "are heavy", "scales", ""]}, {"n": 8, "ar": "فَہُوَ فِیۡ عِیۡشَۃٍ رَّاضِیَۃٍ ؕ﴿۸﴾", "en": "He will have a pleasant life.", "w": ["he", "will have a", "life", "pleasant", ""]}, {"n": 9, "ar": "وَاَمَّا مَنۡ خَفَّتۡ مَوَازِیۡنُہٗ ۙ﴿۹﴾", "en": "But as for him whose scales are light,", "w": ["but as for", "him whose", "are light", "scales", ""]}, {"n": 10, "ar": "فَاُمُّہٗ ہَاوِیَۃٌ ؕ﴿۱۰﴾", "en": "[✲]Hell will be his <i>nursing</i> mother.", "w": ["his <i>nursing</i> mother", "Hell will be", ""]}, {"n": 11, "ar": "وَمَاۤ اَدۡرٰٮکَ مَا ہِیَہۡ ﴿ؕ۱۱﴾", "en": "And what should make thee know what that is?", "w": ["and what", "should make thee know", "what", "that is", ""]}, {"n": 12, "ar": "نَارٌ حَامِیَۃٌ ﴿٪۱۲﴾", "en": "<i>It is</i> a burning Fire.", "w": ["Fire", "<i>it is</i> a burning", ""]}]}